      <div type="clause" n="32">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:Ine">Ine</ref> 32</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">{LXXVI} Gif Wiliscmon hæbbe hide londes, his wer bið CXX sciƚƚ; gif he þonne healfes hæbbe, LXXX sciƚƚ; gif he nænig hæbbe, LX scillinga.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If a Welshman has a hide of land, his wer is 120 shillings; if he, however, has half, 80 shillings; if he has none, 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="secondTranslation" xml:lang="en">If a Welshman possesses a hide of land, his wergeld shall be 120 shillings. If, however, he possesses half a hide, his wergeld shall be 80 shillings ; if he possesses no land — 60 shillings.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif Wilisc mon hæbbe hide londes, his wer bið CXX scll'; gif he þonne hæbbe healfes, LXXX scll'; gif he nænig næbbe, LX scillinga.</ab>
      </div>
